    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69565" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῶλος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>toil and moil</i> of war, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῶλος Ἄρηος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.401
				</span></i>
			, etc.: also without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρηος</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				17.397
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.188
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				257
			</span></i>: once in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξείνου καὶ Ἴρου μῶλος</span>
			<i>struggle between</i> Irus and the stranger, <i><span class="en">
				18.233
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖτ᾽ ἂν Ἄρης μῶλον συνάγῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
